---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'About · Kenechi Ucheagwu';
const description = 'About Kenechi Ucheagwu: IT operations and medical billing at a family-medicine practice, computer science, and nursing.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} path="/about/">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="shell">
      <h1>About</h1>
    </div>
  </header>

  <article class="article shell">
    <section class="article-section about-copy">
      <p>I've worked at the same family-medicine practice since January 2017. I started as a medical assistant: vitals, rooming patients, checking insurance, releasing records and covering the front desk. In August 2021 I took over the billing and coding, and I'm still the practice's only biller. In April 2022 I became its IT Operations & Systems Manager, and for a few months that year I also ran the office day to day. That order matters. I was a user of clinical systems before I ran them, and I coded claims by hand before I automated the work.</p>
      <p>I finished a B.S. in Computer Science at Saint Peter's University in 2022 while working, and I'm now a BSN nursing student at the International College of Health Sciences (expected May 2027), with clinical rotations on medical-surgical and inpatient psychiatric units, charting in Epic. The combination is deliberate. Healthcare IT is full of software built by people who have never touched a clinical workflow, and clinical staff who can't get their systems changed. I sit in the middle on purpose.</p>
      <p>Training and credentials: AHA BLS Provider (2026), HIPAA Security (EPICompliance, 2026), OSHA for Healthcare with Bloodborne Pathogens (EPICompliance, 2026), Healthcare &amp; Billing Practices Compliance (2026), Cyber Crimes industry credential (iQ4/CWA, 2021). Based in Jersey City, NJ. Email is the best way to reach me.</p>
      <div class="link-row" aria-label="Profile links">
        <a href="mailto:kacy.ucheagwu@gmail.com">Email</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/kenechi-ucheagwu">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/kenechi-ucheagwu">LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>
